		"description": "API documentation for the Hostel Issue Tracker project using Firebase Auth and Firestore.\n\n**Version:** 1.0.0\n**Base URL:** https://hostel-issue-tracker.firebaseapp.com\n**Auth:** Firebase Token / OAuth\n**Updated:** 2025-11-13",
